<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Daily Times</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css" />
</head>
<body>

  <main class="newspaper-layout">

    <header class="title">
      <h1>Daily Times</h1>
    </header>

    <article class="feature-article">
      <h2>Major Breakthrough in Renewable Energy</h2>
      <p>
        Scientists have announced a major advancement in renewable energy
        technology that could dramatically reduce the world's dependence on
        fossil fuels.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="secondary-article">
      <h2>Local Community Celebrates Success</h2>
      <p>
        Residents gathered downtown to celebrate the opening of a new community
        center designed to support education and local events.
      </p>
    </article>

    <figure class="cover-image">
      <img
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504711434969-e33886168f5c?w=800"
        alt="Newspaper"
      />
    </figure>

    <article class="small-article1">
      <h3>Sports</h3>
      <p>The home team secured a dramatic victory in the final minutes.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="small-article2">
      <h3>Technology</h3>
      <p>New AI tools continue to transform workplaces around the world.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="small-article3">
      <h3>Weather</h3>
      <p>Sunny skies are expected throughout the weekend with mild temperatures.</p>
    </article>

  </main>

</body>
</html>
